## Keep / drop

| Behavior | Verdict |
| :--- | :--- |
| Linear decay + 25% drop cap + denom guard + 2-decimal round | **Keep** |
| `reps > 12` → return weight | **Keep** |
| `weight <= 0` or `reps <= 0` → 0 | **Keep** |
| `rpe < 6.0` → return weight | **Drop** |
| `0 < rpe < 5.0` clamp to 5.0 | **Keep** (new) |
| RPE 5.0 / 5.5 run as entered | **Keep** (new) |
| `rpe <= 0` → return weight | **Keep** |
| Persist athlete RPE unchanged | **Keep** |
| Executed RPE drives LOG e1RM | **Keep** |
| `RPE_CHART` RPE 6–10 for prescription % | **Keep** (do not extend) |
| Helms/Brzycki library | **Drop** |
| Auto-seed demo sets for the e2e | **Drop** — create a real session like other e2e |

